  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Lang Ya blessed land, Fang Yuan chooses to modify Purple Mountain True Monarch’s wisdom path killer moves because they are powerful, he has grandmaster wisdom path attainment, and he already holds a batch of wisdom path Immortal Gu left behind by Purple Mountain True Monarch. Purple thought light shield is named in that batch with purple blood river formation, ignited thought flying rock, single thought flower blossom, purple thought perception starlight, directional confusion fog, thought body defense, and single thought myriad flow elimination.",
      "chapters": [
        1463
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lang-ya-methods",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has purple thought light shield among other defensive methods, including emperor yama, winter coat, bloodstained conqueror’s robe, hair armor, lion fur armor, divination tortoise transformation, and ghost official garment. It is Purple Mountain True Monarch’s method and had defended against Duke Long’s fists in battle. Fang Yuan only has this killer move and did not cultivate it, because he lacks the crucial Immortal Gu.",
